{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CONQUER EACH FLOOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, Blast, and Dodge your way up the tower with over 100+ unique spells.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/BullethellGif.gif?t=1747994103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong><u>BECOME SUPER POWERFUL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you upgrade a spell, it changes form and becomes even stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/UpgradeGif.gif?t=1747994103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <strong> <u>CUSTOMIZE YOUR BUILD</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether it's a new class, pet, perk or cosmetic, there are lot's of different options to customize each and every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/LoadoutGif.gif?t=1747994103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  <u><strong>Key Features:</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play your way, with several unique classes to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ unique spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face dozens of enemy types and super challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique Spell Upgrade System that <u>isn't</u> just a number increase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore many diverse biomes each filled with new dangerous enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level-Up and assign stat points to further shape your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover NPC's in the tower that will help you face even greater threats!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run, select a game changing perk that compliments your build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of Pet Companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loads of Cosmetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Gacha <u><i>without</i></u> microtransactions (In-game currency only).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hand Designed floors with randomized twists to keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Status Effects Galore - Freeze, burn, stun, and poison. Show those enemies who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3189770?t=1747994103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/a743a354675789c9441107a7f1459f02a44d8f3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747994103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/08151ca2bfc852aaa331a39886283cb8d89da38b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747994103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/08151ca2bfc852aaa331a39886283cb8d89da38b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747994103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>CONQUER EACH FLOOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, Blast, and Dodge your way up the tower with over 100+ unique spells.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/extras/BullethellGif.gif?t=1747994103\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>