zed twists to keep every run fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Status Effects Galore - Freeze, burn, stun, and poison. Show those enemies who's boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shops!!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficulty options to tailor each run to your skill and mood.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ThatOneUnityDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189770/df3a76fb2c49d16c4199e03cd735718572e6d2e8/header.jpg?t=1747994103","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257144106,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144106/movie480.mp4?t=1747991736","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144106/movie_max.mp4?t=1747991736"},"name":"Wishlist Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257144106/44f00546255e1120262bcd2656593c85884d6038/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747991736","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144106/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747991736","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257144106/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747991736"}}],"name":"The Hero Of Pixel Spire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-650 or AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Me